    "deploy": {
      "type": "binary",
      "steps": [
        "curl -fL -o imhex.deb https://github.com/WerWolv/ImHex/releases/download/v1.38.1/imhex-1.38.1-Ubuntu-24.04-x86_64.deb",
        "sudo dpkg -i imhex.deb",
        "imhex --version"
      ],
      "stepsPs": [
        "curl.exe -fL -o imhex.msi https://github.com/WerWolv/ImHex/releases/download/v1.38.1/imhex-1.38.1-Windows-x86_64.msi",
        "Start-Process msiexec -ArgumentList '/i','imhex.msi','/passive' -Wait",
        "Write-Host '安装完成后从开始菜单启动 ImHex'"
      ],
      "source": "https://github.com/WerWolv/ImHex#imhex"
    },
    "pitfalls": [
      "macOS 打不开：在隐私与安全性里允许，或执行 `xattr -rd com.apple.quarantine`",
      "模式加载报错：检查语法与偏移量，模式语言不是标准 C",
      "打开大文件卡顿：启用分页视图",
      "Linux 缺依赖：优先用对应发行版的 deb/rpm",
      "插件装不上：确认 ImHex 版本与插件 ABI 匹配",
      "中文显示异常：在设置里切换字体与编码",
